## Agent Artifacts
- `agent/summary.md`: compact, ranked coding-agent entry point.
- `agent/analysis.jsonl`: one compact non-observation analysis target per line.
- `agent/observations.jsonl`: one observation target per line.
- `agent/metrics.json`: aggregate stats and artifact references.

